    "title": "Rays play again without Ha-Seong Kim, who is sidelined by tight back - NewsBreak",
    "text": "TAMPA — The Rays were short at shortstop on Wednesday, as scheduled starter Ha-Seong Kim was scratched from the lineup with low back tightness. Kim, 29, was said to be on day-to-day status. This is the second time since Kim made his season debut July 4 that he has been sidelined by a back issue.",
